@startuml evolution_timeline
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #333333
  BorderThickness 1
}

rectangle "**Generation 1**
Rule-Based
(1990s-2000s)

Static Firewalls
Reactive Response" as Gen1 #FFE6E6

rectangle "**Generation 2**
ML Defense
(2000s-2010s)

Pattern Recognition
Signature Detection" as Gen2 #E6F3FF

rectangle "**Generation 3**
Adaptive Learning
(2010s-Present)

Dynamic Adaptation
Behavior Analysis" as Gen3 #E6FFE6

rectangle "**Generation 4**
Adversarial Learning
(Our Work)

Predictive Defense
Adversarial Training" as Gen4 #FFFACD

Gen1 -right-> Gen2 : Evolution
Gen2 -right-> Gen3 : Evolution  
Gen3 -right-> Gen4 : **Our
Contribution**

note bottom of Gen1 : 1990
note bottom of Gen2 : 2000
note bottom of Gen3 : 2010
note bottom of Gen4 : 2025

@enduml
